These cats have an [[Special Abilities|Ability]] called Witch Killer. Against [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witch]] enemies, they deal 5x damage and only take 1/10 in return.
This ability is boosted by the combo [[My Very Best Friend (Combo)|My Very Best Friend]], which boosts the damage bonus to 25x and the defense bonus to 1/50.

